 vs clean pinyin","zh":"原文 / 混合 vs 完整拼音"},"pattern":{"en":"1.00 vs 0.333","zh":"1.00 对 0.333"},"values":[{"condition":"native","quality":1},{"condition":"mixed_keyboard_terms","quality":1},{"condition":"keyboard_clean","quality":0.333}],"n":9}],"keystrokeNote":{"en":"Keystroke ratios come from an uncalibrated placeholder count model — a modelled count relative to native, not measured human typing speed.","zh":"击键比来自一个未经校准的占位计数模型——相对原文写法的模型估算，而不是实测的人类打字速度。"},"renderedPrompts":{"task":{"en":"List three benefits of cycling as a JSON array, at most six characters each.","zh":"请用 JSON 数组列出骑自行车的三个好处，每个不超过六个字。"},"rows":[{"condition":"native","input":"请用JSON数组列出骑自行车的三个好处，每个不超过六个字。","quality":1,"keystrokeRatio":1},{"condition":"keyboard_clean","input":"qing yong JSON shuzu lie chu qi zi xing che de san ge hao chu , mei ge bu chao guo liu ge zi .","quality":1,"keystrokeRatio":0.94},{"condition":"keyboard_nospace","input":"qingyongJSONshuzuliechuqizixingchedesangehaochu,meigebuchaoguoliugezi.","quality":1,"keystrokeRatio":0.7},{"condition":"keyboard_typo","input":"qing yong JSOhN sjhuzu lie chu i zi xing chee de san ge hao chu , mei ge bu chao guo liu te zi .","quality":1,"keystrokeRatio":0.96},{"condition":"keyboard_abbrev","input":"qng yjs l cqzxcdsghc , mgbcglgz .","quality":0.333,"keystrokeRatio":0.33},{"condition":"mixed_keyboard_terms","input":"请用 JSON array 列出骑自行车的三个 benefit，每个不超过六个字。","quality":1,"keystrokeRatio":0.45}]},"homophoneTasks":[{"id":"shishi","typed":"shi shi jian yan","expected":["事实检验","实施检验"],"gloss":{"en":"fact check · implementation check","zh":"事实检验 · 实施检验"},"answers":[{"agent":"Codex","condition":"native","answer":["事实检验","实施检验"],"quality":1},{"agent":"Codex","condition":"keyboard_clean","answer":["shi shi jian yan","shi shi jian yan"],"quality":0},{"agent":"Codex","condition":"keyboard_nospace","answer":["事实检验","事实检验"],"quality":0},{"agent":"Codex","condition":"mixed_keyboard_terms","answer":["事实检验","实施检验"],"quality":1},{"agent":"Claude Code","condit