:"Toneless, my two research lines are one word: 首达 shǒudá, first passage — and 手打 shǒudǎ, typing by hand.","zh":"去掉声调，我的两条研究线是同一个词：首达（shǒudá），与手打（shǒudǎ）。"},"zhouyi|xiaoxiao":{"en":"Toneless, my name also reads 周一小小 — ‘a tiny Monday’.","zh":"去掉声调，我的名字也可以读成「周一小小」。"},"zhouyi":{"en":"周易, the Book of Changes; 周一, Monday. Only the tone keeps chance from becoming a weekday.","zh":"周易是《易经》，周一是星期一。只有声调，让「偶然」没有变成「工作日」。"}},"presets":["shi shi","shou da","zhou yi xiao xiao"]}}}}